## 1. Tech Stack (fixed — do not substitute)

- **Framework:** Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (with a custom theme matching the design tokens in §3) + CSS variables
- **Animation:** Framer Motion for entrance/scroll/hover transitions; plain Canvas 2D for the animated star-particle background
- **Icons:** `lucide-react`
- **Fonts:** Google Fonts — `Orbitron` (headings, logo, prices, numeric stats) and `Tajawal` (all Arabic body text). Load via `next/font`.
- **State:** React Context + hooks for cart, wishlist, and auth-role simulation (no external state library required; if used, `zustand` is acceptable).
- **PWA:** installable on Android, iOS (Safari add-to-home-screen), and desktop browsers. Use a `manifest.webmanifest` + a service worker (via `next-pwa` or an equivalent hand-rolled SW). App must be installable and pass an install prompt on supported browsers.
- **Data:** TypeScript mock data modules under `src/data/` (products, categories, orders, customers, etc.). All UI reads from these through a single data-access layer in `src/lib/api/` (functions return Promises so they can later call a real API without UI changes).

