## 12. Acceptance Criteria (must all pass)

1. `npm install` → `npm run dev` runs with **zero errors and zero warnings**; `npm run build` succeeds cleanly with **zero TypeScript errors**.
2. Every screen listed in §6 and §7 exists, is reachable, and renders correctly with mock data.
3. Fully **Arabic RTL** throughout, no leftover English in the UI, no layout breakage in RTL.
4. **Responsive** and correct at mobile (<640), tablet (640–1024), and desktop (>1024). Mobile shows the bottom nav; desktop shows the top navbar.
5. **Touch-friendly:** all targets ≥44px; every hover action also works on tap; custom cursor disabled on touch; iOS safe-areas respected; full-height uses `100dvh`.
6. The **animated star-particle background is live and moving** (with connection lines, twinkle, orbs), and honors `prefers-reduced-motion` and tab-visibility.
7. Cart, wishlist, coupons, filters, sort, search, checkout steps, and login-role routing all **work** against mock data.
8. Admin dashboard charts, KPIs (count-up), tables, product form with multi-image uploader, and all admin sections **work** against mock data.
9. **PWA installs** on Android/desktop (install prompt) and shows iOS add-to-home instructions; launches standalone with the correct icon, name, and theme color.
10. Numbers render in **Western digits**; dates/prices formatted consistently.
11. Code is organized per §4; all data flows through `src/lib/api/*`; types are shared; no mock data hard-coded inside components.

